  "contentHtml": "<p>시각자료를 만드는 활동을</p><p>어려워하는 학생들이 많습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그래서&#160;</p><p>아래와 같이 시각자료를 프린트해서 주고</p><p>그림을 자르고,</p><p>해당 내용 설명을</p><p>학생들이 작성하게 하는 활동도 좋겠습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce3141a8c7e6426181914efa039c4ab2a926bdcc\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"700\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ce3141a8c7e6426181914efa039c4ab2a926bdcc\" data-origin-width=\"1199\" data-origin-height=\"694\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/864bae11589e54a6c102759038f1bb95f68da55f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"500\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/864bae11589e54a6c102759038f1bb95f68da55f\" data-origin-width=\"901\" data-origin-height=\"1232\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9afca4fb49c5ea0079b06b75162fc97d6f7de06d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"600\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9afca4fb49c5ea0079b06b75162fc97d6f7de06d\" data-origin-width=\"901\" data-origin-height=\"1199\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fcf911777d234fb7c5a0da3e9323cf80e37e5e78\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fcf911777d234fb7c5a0da3e9323cf80e37e5e78\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"901\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
